creatures:
- name: Hobgoblin Warrior
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 18  
      **Hit Points** 11 (rollable(dice=2d8 + 2,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** 30 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Initiative) (13)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=9)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Gear** half plate armor, longbow, longsword, shield  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 10  
      **Languages** Common, Goblin  
      **Challenge** 1/2 (100 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Traits

      ***Pack Tactics.*** The hobgoblin has ***Advantage*** on an attack roll against a creature if at least one of the hobgoblin's allies is within 5 feet of the creature and the ally doesn't have the ***Incapacitated*** condition.

      ## Actions

      ***Longsword.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=To Hit [Longsword]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d10+1,dicelabel=Damage [Longsword]) Slashing damage.

      ***Longbow.*** *Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=To Hit [Longbow]), range 150/600 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d8+1,dicelabel=Damage [Longbow]) Piercing damage plus rollable(dice=3d4,dicelabel=Damage [Longbow]) Poison damage.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Medium Fey (Goblinoid), Lawful Evil*  
    **Challenge** 1/2
